Statement of changes (Apache License 2.0, section 4b)
-----------------------------------------------------

30 of the 112 task JSON files have been modified. The remaining 82 are
byte-identical to the originals.

  13 llm_boolean `rubric` values rewritten
  17 jmespath `query` values rewritten
  14 jmespath `expected_value` values rewritten
   1 `goal` value rewritten (dashdish-5)

Each modification corrects a scoring artefact that a correct execution of the
task could not satisfy. No task file, eval, or eval criterion was added,
removed, or reordered, and the `id`, `type`, `challengeType`, `website` and
`points` fields are unmodified throughout.

Every individual change is recorded, with its original and replacement value,
in CHANGES.md and corrections.json.
